= Blockchain — Technical =

A blockchain combines replicated state, authenticated transactions, cryptographic commitments, ordered blocks, and a consensus protocol. Security properties such as safety, liveness, finality, and resistance to history revision depend on the consensus model, network timing, validator/adversary assumptions, and implementation.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* blockchain ≠ cryptocurrency
* blockchain ≠ every distributed ledger
* tamper-resistant ≠ absolutely immutable

